{"id":"vod_md_5798","vodId":"5798","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"少女与战车","name_cn":"少女与战车","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231008-1/f82927208347520b2175f688d9271101.jpg"},"summary":"出生于坦克世家的高中少女西住美穗（渕上舞 配音），早已厌烦了被作为传统文化在世界范围内普及、号称修炼女性的“战车道”。为了逃避这个恼人的宿命，美穗特意转学至没有这一科目的大洗，并结交了渴望浪漫爱情的武部沙织（茅野爱衣 配音）和擅长花道的五十铃华（尾崎真实 配音）两位好友。谁知日本即将举行战车道大赛，美穗所在的大戏女子学园也顺应恢复了战车道的科目。由于相关经验学院短缺，在学生会长强迫之下，美穗和两位朋友一同选修战车道。对于这门停滞已久的学科，18名少女们寻找废弃战车、维修护理、进修操作和作战课程、实战演习……，如此等等，一切都从头开始。经过一段时间的艰苦磨练，大洗女子学园的少女们驾驶着神采奕奕的战车，开向了高手如云的全国大赛会场……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-08 08:16:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/xuPEz6ln/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/jrdB5iKE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/uKJHAtIb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/0ImQC6oO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/cWMWgFgQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/ynCYWGLC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/DaHOxSx2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/lLAwwX2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/JW43fzH4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/6eGys3o3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/pdAeDBgn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/cd97Zc7s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/M06lVA7s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/JNFWFoIu/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:03.643Z"}